# /api/ca, the contract address watcher (@nullxnothing/solana-launch-kit/ca-watch). Server-only:
# the reserved mint never goes in a client variable, or the vanity CA leaks before launch.
# Set on Vercel through ~/Scripts/env-sync (manifest: solgent). Empty mint = the CA row hides.
SOLGENT_RESERVED_MINT=
# The launch (dev) wallet that must have created the coin on pump for the CA to show.
SOLGENT_CREATOR=
HELIUS_API_KEY=
